; The three D3D UMD entry points d3d10warp.dll exports (dumpbin /exports, verified on
; win11 10.0.26100.8875). OpenAdapter12 is the one this proxy is for; the other two are
; pass-throughs so an app-local copy does not break D3D10/11 on WARP.
EXPORTS
    OpenAdapter12
    OpenAdapter
    OpenAdapter10_2
